OPERATORS:
->Operators are symbols used to perform operations on values.
->There are four important categories.
        -Arithmetic operators
           CODE   var a = 10
                  var b = 5
                  print(a + b)--->15
                  print(a - b)--->5
                  print(a * b)--->50
                  print(a / b)--->2
                  print(a % 3)--->1
        -Comparison operators
          CODE    var age = 21
                  print(age > 18)------->true
                  print(age == 21)------>true
                  print(age < 18)------->false
        -Logical operators
          CODE    var age = 21
                  var hasID = true
                  print(age >= 18 && hasID)----->true
        -Assignment operators
          CODE    var number = 10
                  number += 5  //means number = number + 5.
                  print(number)---->15
